{"task_id": "Mbpp/11", "solution": "def remove_Occ(s, char):\n    # Find first and last occurrence positions\n    first_pos = s.find(char)\n    if first_pos == -1:\n        return s\n    \n    last_pos = s.rfind(char)\n    \n    # If only one occurrence, remove it\n    if first_pos == last_pos:\n        return s[:first_pos] + s[first_pos + 1:]\n    \n    # Remove both first and last occurrences\n    result = s[:first_pos] + s[first_pos + 1:last_pos] + s[last_pos + 1:]\n    return result"}
