{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 2:\n        return 1\n    \n    # Initialize sequence array\n    seq = [0] * (n + 1)\n    seq[1] = seq[2] = 1\n    \n    # Fill sequence using recurrence relation: P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1))\n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        seq[i] = seq[seq[i-1]] + seq[i - seq[i-1]]\n    \n    return seq[n]"}
