{"task_id": "Mbpp/123", "solution": "def amicable_numbers_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the sum of all amicable numbers from 1 to n.\"\"\"\n    def sum_of_divisors(num):\n        total = 0\n        for i in range(1, int(num**0.5) + 1):\n            if num % i == 0:\n                total += i\n                if i != 1 and i != num // i:\n                    total += num // i\n        return total\n    \n    amicable_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        divisor_sum = sum_of_divisors(i)\n        if divisor_sum != i and divisor_sum <= n and sum_of_divisors(divisor_sum) == i:\n            amicable_sum += i\n    \n    return amicable_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/123", "solution": "def amicable_numbers_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the sum of all amicable numbers from 1 to n.\"\"\"\n    def sum_proper_divisors(num):\n        if num <= 1:\n            return 0\n        divisor_sum = 1\n        for i in range(2, int(num**0.5) + 1):\n            if num % i == 0:\n                divisor_sum += i\n                if i != num // i:\n                    divisor_sum += num // i\n        return divisor_sum\n    \n    amicable_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        sum_i = sum_proper_divisors(i)\n        sum_sum_i = sum_proper_divisors(sum_i)\n        if i == sum_sum_i and i != sum_i:\n            amicable_sum += i\n    \n    return amicable_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/125", "solution": "def find_length(binary_string):\n    # Convert to array where 0s become +1 and 1s become -1\n    arr = [1 if c == '0' else -1 for c in binary_string]\n    \n    # Find maximum subarray sum using Kadane's algorithm\n    max_sum = float('-inf')\n    current_sum = 0\n    \n    for num in arr:\n        current_sum = max(num, current_sum + num)\n        max_sum = max(max_sum, current_sum)\n    \n    return max_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/126", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find the sum of common divisors of two given numbers.\nassert sum(10,15) == 6\n\"\"\"\ndef sum_common_divisors(a, b):\n    \"\"\"Find the sum of common divisors of two numbers.\"\"\"\n    def gcd(x, y):\n        while y:\n            x, y = y, x % y\n        return x\n    \n    g = gcd(a, b)\n    total = 0\n    for i in range(1, int(g**0.5) + 1):\n        if g % i == 0:\n            total += i\n            if i != g // i:\n                total += g // i\n    return total"}
