{"task_id": "Mbpp/126", "solution": "def sum_common_divisors(a, b):\n    \"\"\"Find sum of all common divisors of two numbers.\"\"\"\n    def gcd(x, y):\n        while y:\n            x, y = y, x % y\n        return x\n    \n    g = gcd(a, b)\n    result = 0\n    i = 1\n    while i * i <= g:\n        if g % i == 0:\n            result += i\n            if i != g // i:\n                result += g // i\n        i += 1\n    return result"}
