{"task_id": "Mbpp/223", "solution": "def is_majority(arr, n, element):\n    # Find first and last occurrence of element using binary search\n    def find_first():\n        left, right = 0, n - 1\n        first = -1\n        while left <= right:\n            mid = (left + right) // 2\n            if arr[mid] == element:\n                first = mid\n                right = mid - 1\n            elif arr[mid] < element:\n                left = mid + 1\n            else:\n                right = mid - 1\n        return first\n    \n    def find_last():\n        left, right = 0, n - 1\n        last = -1\n        while left <= right:\n            mid = (left + right) // 2\n            if arr[mid] == element:\n                last = mid\n                left = mid + 1\n            elif arr[mid] < element:\n                left = mid + 1\n            else:\n                right = mid - 1\n        return last\n    \n    first = find_first()\n    if first == -1:\n        return False\n    \n    last = find_last()\n    count = last - first + 1\n    return count > n // 2"}
