{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum_repeated(arr, n, k):\n    # Handle edge cases\n    if not arr or k == 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Create the repeated array\n    repeated_arr = arr * k\n    \n    # Apply Kadane's algorithm to find maximum subarray sum\n    max_sum = repeated_arr[0]\n    current_sum = repeated_arr[0]\n    \n    for i in range(1, len(repeated_arr)):\n        current_sum = max(repeated_arr[i], current_sum + repeated_arr[i])\n        max_sum = max(max_sum, current_sum)\n    \n    return max_sum"}
