{"task_id": "Mbpp/608", "solution": "def bell_Number(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the nth Bell number using dynamic programming.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n    \n    # Create triangle to store Bell numbers\n    bell = [[0 for i in range(n+1)] for j in range(n+1)]\n    bell[0][0] = 1\n    \n    for i in range(1, n+1):\n        # First number in each row is same as last number in previous row\n        bell[i][0] = bell[i-1][i-1]\n        \n        # Fill remaining entries in current row\n        for j in range(1, i+1):\n            bell[i][j] = bell[i-1][j-1] + bell[i][j-1]\n    \n    return bell[n][0]"}
