{"task_id": "Mbpp/721", "solution": "def maxAverageOfPath(grid):\n    n = len(grid)\n    \n    def dfs(i, j, total_cost, path_length):\n        if i == n - 1 and j == n - 1:\n            return (total_cost + grid[i][j]) / (path_length + 1)\n        \n        max_avg = float('-inf')\n        \n        if i + 1 < n:\n            max_avg = max(max_avg, dfs(i + 1, j, total_cost + grid[i][j], path_length + 1))\n        \n        if j + 1 < n:\n            max_avg = max(max_avg, dfs(i, j + 1, total_cost + grid[i][j], path_length + 1))\n        \n        return max_avg\n    \n    return dfs(0, 0, 0, 0)"}
